2-31","2024-12-31","2025-12-31"]},"intro":{"text":"We are a clinical-stage biopharmaceutical company developing next-generation, once-daily, oral phosphodiesterase-4 (\u201cPDE4\u201d) inhibitor prodrugs designed for targeted delivery to the terminal ileum and colon. Our lead clinical product candidate, PALI-2108, is being developed as a treatment for patients living with inflammatory bowel disease (\u201cIBD\u201d), including ulcerative colitis (\u201cUC\u201d) and Crohn\u2019s disease (\u201cCD\u201d). We are committed to advancing a next generation of once daily, oral PDE4 inhibitor prodrugs to improve pharmacology, tolerability and convenience for patients with inflammatory and fibrotic diseases.","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1357459/000135745926000004/pali-20251231.htm","filed":"2026-03-20","source":"10-K"},"keep":7,"hist":2,"da_v":2}